{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act18mini_level_act18mini_st06",
  "groupId": "act18mini",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "未明啟示",
  "storyCode": "",
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act18mini/level_act18mini_st06.txt",
  "sourceHash": "c7997aff8afadb04935905baf244c7a4354c9a79a5048e3bd1e00196e2b10f28",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "43_g1_giantmonstercockpit"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "<p=1>“生命脊椎”</><p=2>1098年10月，薩卡茲大撤軍</>"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "赫德雷，接受使用骸骨撤退的我都帶過來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大部分都是禁不起長途行軍的傢伙。年長的、年紀小的，還有很多傷員，幾乎都在這裡了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W放話“隨便他們要不要送死”的傷員也被她小隊裡的其他人抬上來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她活著的手下竟然還有不少，足以在“生命脊椎”內部維護秩序，也足以盯著被關押的厄爾蘇拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以不必擔心你在路上突然死了之後，沒有人能接手駕駛的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在等什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“生命脊椎”在戰場的廢墟上投下一片陰影。\n沒有薩卡茲抬頭，或許他們知道，或許已經習慣，將有一片更大的陰影籠罩這支綿延數里的隊伍。\n為了翻越高速軍艦留下的溝壑，大多數人步履緩慢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在想……撤軍的隊伍竟然那麼長。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡茲戴爾和維多利亞之間的路，我們都走過，都知道要走多久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但要是維多利亞人現在出爾反爾，朝著薩卡茲的隊伍開炮，你也做不了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，事情一向如此。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕不是現在……等我們向全泰拉發出訊號時，各國必定有所反應。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定那個辦法能奏效嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如此張揚地退回卡茲戴爾，恐怕會令很多國家恐慌不已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但確實沒有更好的辦法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這支隊伍必須繼續向所有勢力展現出最強勢的一面。一旦失去揮動武器的力氣，這些人馬上就會被吃得連骨頭都不剩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那位新的“魔王”也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "主動權必須握在我們自己的手裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "透過骸骨看向外面，飛空艇若隱若現，艦炮的索敵狀態也一直沒有解除。\n在它的周圍則是一片隨著撤軍隊伍移動的巨大天災雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但還有一件事讓我很擔心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊內絲",
      "speakerId": "avg_4087_ines_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你確定讓W看守曼弗雷德是個好主意？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "赫德雷",
      "speakerId": "avg_4088_hodrer_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她的確是最適合的人選。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "隊伍已抵達指定地點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "天氣晴朗，能見度良好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "持續瞭望東南方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們已經收到了國防部同步給我們的最新情報，其中還包括了卡茲戴爾的大概座標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請持續追蹤薩卡茲軍隊在撤軍返鄉的旗號掩護下有何實際動作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "事實上，軍官並不明白追蹤薩卡茲有什麼意義。\n但出於對合作夥伴的尊重，他坐在偵察車裡，聚精會神地盯著無人機傳回來的資料。\n風平浪靜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "目前沒有異常狀況，先生。所以，只是隨便聊聊……梅蘭德很少派像您這樣身分的代表出面與軍方聯絡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵呵，維多利亞人自以為將倫蒂尼姆的災難掩飾得很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅蘭德需要調查一些情況，然後跟他們談談。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……少尉，少尉！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "及時報告情況！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，目前沒有新的進展……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼都沒有？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，那是……？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "軍官放下了通訊器。車載天災預警系統正在發出尖銳的警報聲。\n他朝特區的方向望去，這個距離下他幾乎看不見移動城市的輪廓。\n但他看到天災雲投下了一片龐大的陰影，從特區的上空一直蔓延到自己的頭頂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "44_g6_towerterrace"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恭敬的侍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，他知道您與敘拉古的那些人熟識，所以希望您這一次有機會施展才能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請放心。數量龐大的薩卡茲是災禍，是無序的軍事力量……但也是傭兵。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在我們已經知道，我們的鄰居維多利亞無法好好看管他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我有信心，不讓那些污穢干擾萊塔尼亞的輝煌樂章。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請您如此傳話給您的主人——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "驟然昏暗的天色打斷了他的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "萊塔尼亞貴族",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_493_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恭敬的侍者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_498_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "請隨我進屋，先生！是天災！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聯絡基地，要求指令……見鬼……訊號全都中斷了！真該死！車隊馬力全部開到最大！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_thundercloud"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "天災預警系統顯示的資料讓他感到一陣更為強烈的惡寒。\n天災雲驟然停止了膨脹，就如同幾分鐘前，它毫無徵兆地出現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "狂風將源石粉塵捲上天空，然而源石卻沒有再掉落下來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "29_g2_edgeofbase"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "而後，烏雲緩緩散去，透出日光。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……能聽到嗎，少尉？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，先生……我們什麼都沒有觀測到，天災雲是突然出現的……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當然，當然。這是一次該死的展示、炫耀以及威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您認為是薩卡茲的軍隊——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "梅蘭德不需要你們協助調查了，請及時撤回。當然，也請您對本次合作的全部內容進行保密。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "哥倫比亞軍官",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊另一端的聲音",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_901_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仍願泰拉……保佑我們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_23_G03"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾報業主編",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "夠了，把熱線電話掛掉！關於天災雲的目擊描述已經夠多了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾報業主編",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家都看得清清楚楚，我們這些坐在高樓裡的人離它更近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾報業主編",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "現在最重要的是拿出你們的解釋，寫出合格的新聞。每個人都寫，隨便你是把它解釋成廣告廠商投影還是萊塔尼亞的新法術流派。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾報業主編",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你還有什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是民眾來電……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的信使傳訊息回來了……崔林特爾梅、拉特蘭城還有蒙特盧佩……各國首都的上空都陸續出現了天災雲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾報業主編",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聖駿堡和麥克斯特區呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米爾職員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_223",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“阿喃那”這個小東西還蠻不錯啊，竟然轉眼間就能把天災送到別人家門口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，難怪我們要帶走它的時候，博士和老女人會那麼緊張，小兔子還非要跟上來看著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯……要是我們乾脆一鼓作氣把那幾個核心圈國家的首都毀了……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許它能將恐懼降臨在核心圈國家的首都，但也不代表能摧毀那些國家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我很肯定，這份侮辱能換回來的，只有對卡茲戴爾的報復。我們最初的歷史已經證明了這一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不是個明智的決定，維什戴爾。還是謹慎一點使用吧，它對思維和身體造成的負擔遠超我的想像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你剛剛才切身體會過那種痛苦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "輪不到你來告訴我，曼弗雷德。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們能理解“阿喃那”正確的使用方式，它所能做到的，遠非只有恐嚇這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兩位殿下所期許的，也並非如此。它的確是武器，是威懾，但更是擺脫我們宿命的基石——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你比赫德雷更煩人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "曼弗雷德，不要忘了自己的身分。你只是一個囚徒，你現在還活著的唯一原因是卡茲戴爾需要你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而軍事委員會還能夠存在的唯一原因，也只是還活著的薩卡茲依舊需要一個信念支撐他們回到家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡，特雷西斯的手段真是高明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……赫德雷早就猜到了，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這本來就是攝政王殿下的陽謀，被仇恨再次凝聚的族群，重新團結在卡茲戴爾的周圍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴別塔和軍事委員會的再一次合作，為了同一個目標。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要妄想這樣你就能躲過審判，曼弗雷德。記住我的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "維什戴爾……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你還沒說完？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果卡茲戴爾真的有和其他國家恢復正常關係的那一天，就如特蕾西婭殿下曾努力的那樣……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我，還有軍事委員會的其他人都必須和卡茲戴爾劃清界線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對薩卡茲而言，外族人是為我們帶來仇恨的人，而我們對那些國家的人亦然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們遲早會主張我們犯下的罪並未清洗，而我會等著那些復仇者找到我們——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "閉嘴吧，曼弗雷德。少擺出一副好好先生的模樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特雷西斯和你們做了蠢事，蠢到我恨不得把你們全都挫骨揚灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別忘了，那些真心相信你們的計劃的戰爭瘋子，幾乎都陪食腐者葬送在倫蒂尼姆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們親手害死了那些蠢貨。我們能救下來、能帶著撤退的人已經剩沒多少了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但薩卡茲犯下的錯，自然由薩卡茲承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴別塔還沒有懦弱到會為了一群敢來挑釁卡茲戴爾的雜碎，就把軍事委員會一口氣全都丟到城外。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "殿下絕不會這麼做，我也不會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們要是敢來，我不介意再打一架。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要是繼續囉哩囉嗦，我就把你丟給某個願意和你瞎聊這些蠢事的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "曼弗雷德",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_404_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不害怕嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看那邊移動的天災雲，看起來明明很遠，但總覺得它隨時就會跑到我的頭頂上……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怕，怕死了，哪有人不怕天災的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過我在薩米學會了一招，只要害怕就把帽子戴在頭上，蹲在那裡想點開心的事，想著想著，恐怖的東西就自己不見了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，我只是在走我自己的路，他們不會平白無故地為難我吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "上週你還說自己不知道是第幾次被不同家族的人抓起來審問了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，給你們添麻煩了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但誤會總是會解開的，你們最後還是把我放了嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……真是想不通你這個傢伙是怎麼活著一路穿過薩米和烏薩斯的，總不可能是在吹牛吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我總是能遇到講道理的人，就像你們一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，天災不聽人講道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對了，你是要去哪裡？是“黑流樹海”嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是啊，也是回家，朋友，回玻利瓦爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那個地方太遠了，沒差這一兩天，而且你抓著的那張破符紙又不會過期。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論如何，我勸你先等等，等那幫瘋子的隊伍過去。他們發動了戰爭，可以毀滅城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或者，等別的東西幫你測試一下那場天災。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是一個朋友的忠告。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那群魔族佬這麼張揚，總會有人想要試探著從他們那裡咬下一塊肉的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他能聽到遠方天災雲的恐怖聲勢，也能隱隱聽到軍艦引擎轟鳴的聲音。\n這位敘拉古的朋友說得沒錯，或許插手這件事並不明智，但……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "敘拉古家族成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_600_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帕尤卡卡……你總不可能真的被那駭人的天災雲迷住了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許吧。我看到沒見過的景象，就壓抑不住好奇心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "的確，我在薩米時因為這個毛病吃過虧，可惜我就是改不掉自己的毛病。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更準確地說，我想去看看那群頂著天災雲走路的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情況怎樣？但願沒有人為難你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是又一場普通的葬禮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……天災下的葬禮，恐怕不算是普通了。這對很多人不公平，他們本來應該和我們一起回到卡茲戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "死亡已是我們中絕大多數人最容易觸碰到的平等，Misery。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "絕大多數的死者已無親無故，亦無姓名。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "當初我請他們留下遺言時，沒有人知道會有誰為自己的死亡而哀悼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我令霧氣在眾人安葬之處繚繞，以免野獸驚擾，但對大多數人而言，他們終究未能如願歸鄉，將屍骨投入熔爐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Logos，你知道再往前走一點是什麼地方嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我之前的任務……很少需要在這個附近行動。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再往南走一點就是拉特蘭了，不遠。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Outcast和我一起在附近出任務時，她常常帶我來這邊喝酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們打過一個愚蠢的賭——我會找機會偷偷溜進去嚐嚐拉特蘭當地的冰淇淋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我做到了，沒有人能看得到我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我也沒能讓她看到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，至少這次失約的不是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以你特意拒絕了和阿斯卡綸一同回本艦的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道我們撤退的路線會經過這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要亂猜我的心思，Logos。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有阿斯卡綸在，護送我們那些犧牲的同事和他們的信物回到本艦的任務，不會有任何問題。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "況且，她也需要一些獨處的時間……告別過去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我曾試著與她討論撤軍事宜，但她保持了緘默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許她對之後的事務都不會再有什麼看法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她親歷了一個時代的落幕，Logos。那種感覺真的很難受，恐怕未來我們的會議又要少一個人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Misery嘆了一口氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰也不確定將來還會發生什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我們頭上的天災雲……雖然我不喜歡這個計劃，但我不得不承認，對那些想趁機與薩卡茲開戰的軍隊而言，這就是最強大的威懾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "若不以強硬手段避免戰爭，返歸卡茲戴爾的旅程會有更多無謂的犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Logos",
      "speakerId": "avg_4133_logos_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暴力是手段，不是目的。這並無不妥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但，或許是我太過悲觀……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Misery",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_235",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只覺得，雨終歸是會落下來的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "27_g26_dusk_wild"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，所以能放開我了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你到底是什麼人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我真的只是一個探險家……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從來沒見過能讓天災雲裡的雷電都避開的探險家，就像、就像它們在害怕你……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許是喜歡我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，不是有幾道雷電就在我身邊炸開了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這麼說，只會讓自己看起來更可疑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想我們頭上這些天災雲表達的態度已經很清楚了——別靠近，也別想試探我們！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等等，我只是想來研究一下你們弄出來的奇怪天災雲，順便提醒你們一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不喜歡你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的謊言太多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "薩卡茲傭兵衡量著眼前對方的真實實力，猶豫著要不要動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這就是那個有問題的人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起來也很普通嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老傢伙，你確定沒有認錯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "死魂靈的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他身上有我討厭的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "死魂靈的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（古老的薩卡茲語）“施矛狄卡”……外來的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "死魂靈的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不是那些傢伙親自來了，是他隨身帶著的一個東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "死魂靈的聲音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，好像只是……一張紙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呿，你真是燒糊塗了，老傢伙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "意思是不用再警惕他了？喂，怎麼不說話了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大，我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說了以後叫議長。麻煩死了，赫德雷非要搞這些無聊的規矩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……明明議長只能是殿下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，派你們這支小隊出來偵察，你們就繼續去做偵察的事，這個傢伙交給我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雇傭兵斥候",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_053",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "聽你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有話直說，別搞小動作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我保證我的動作會比你更快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有艦隊朝你們過來。沒辦法確定來自哪個國家，他們關閉了所有訊號識別功能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "方向是那邊。那一帶有地形掩護，軍隊很容易埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說不定誰都想插一腳呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，一群懦夫。害怕我們，又想假裝信心滿滿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "好，讓我轉告給那些衝在前面送死的老夥計。\n——喂，聽到了嗎？偵察時注意埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為感謝，要不我請你看一下天災雲？你不是來“探險”的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，還是不用了……我怕得發抖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你走吧，要是再有薩卡茲不識相地抓住你，就告訴他們放你走的是我——維什戴爾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好險好險，要不是你及時搭救，我就要不明不白地死在旅途中了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別再在我面前說謊了，我知道你是故意被抓住的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": "avg_1035_wisdel_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是奇怪，我怎麼總能遇到一些跟薩卡茲沒有半點關係、偏偏要來幫忙的好心人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黎博利看著眼前這個貌似輕鬆的薩卡茲，他敏銳地發現了這位應該是這群人首領的人，注意力早已不在自己的身上。\n她在注意遠方，她相信了自己的警告。\n風帶來了大地的聲音……或是軍艦的引擎聲。\n紛爭、戰亂，探險家一路走來已經看過了太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕尤卡卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1663_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wilderness_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……他們來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩卡茲戰士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_054",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就知道想回去沒那麼容易。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "大地在震動。\n高速軍艦從陰影中緩緩駛出，擋在了薩卡茲前進的道路上。\n在倫蒂尼姆時，戰士已經幾次展開這樣的衝鋒，他認為自己應該是百裡挑一的幸運兒。\n他也很清楚，想回到卡茲戴爾，能走的不是一條普通的路，而是一片屍山血海的戰場。\n在軍艦主炮所能抵達的最遠距離之外，薩卡茲的大部隊停下了腳步。\n天色變得陰沉，頭頂的黑雲翻滾著雷霆，他們的敵人越來越近。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有人按指揮做好準備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "做好自己的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不想看到任何傻子在這種時候逞強——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "維什戴爾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "只有很少一部分薩卡茲注意到了隊伍裡那個小小的卡特斯女孩。\n她一路走到隊伍的最前列。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然後，她揮動法杖，在身後畫下一條線。黑色的線在大地上蔓延。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "接著，黑牆升起，橫貫大地。\n黑色絲線織出的、無法逾越的高牆，將對峙的雙方隔絕開來。\n所有薩卡茲都無法再看到黑牆那頭的卡特斯少女——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他們只能記得她頭頂懸浮的黑冠。\n魔王。\n他們的魔王沒有拋棄他們？他們擁有了一位新的魔王？\n但為何是……異族的魔王？\n卡特斯的聲音同一時間於在場的所有薩卡茲心中響起，而前來阻攔薩卡茲的艦隊也清楚地聽到了黑牆下那位少女的話語——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩卡茲將會回家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果必須使用暴力，我不會排斥……我清楚這頂黑色王冠的重量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "特蕾西婭小姐已經帶著眾魂離開，薩卡茲第一次擁有了選擇的餘地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不能容忍她的努力白費。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不想讓薩卡茲或是你們，再次掀起另一場戰爭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……仇恨的循環，該結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "特蕾西婭在內化宇宙中教會了阿米婭關於黑王冠的一切後，阿米婭第一次毫無保留地展示了自己的身分。\n而她也在那一瞬間，聽到了薩卡茲群體中嘈雜的聲音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "恐懼、質疑、崇敬、迷狂，無數情緒湧入阿米婭的腦海。\n以前，她也多次嘗試探索那頂黑色王冠中儲存的訊息，但從未走得這麼遠。\n訊息的浪潮幾乎快將她捲走，千萬年來，薩卡茲們急切地尋求著“魔王”，尋求著縹緲的願景。\n她竭力穩定思緒，維持著那堵不可撼動的黑牆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是統治者，也不是薩卡茲的王。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使薩卡茲會因此憎恨我，我亦接受。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會指引前路，直抵苦難的盡頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都退下吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不會有更多的戰爭了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "黑牆依舊，天災也盤旋於荒野之上。\n僵持許久之後，艦隊中的第一艘軍艦終於開始調轉方向。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，總算……"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "紛繁的思緒突然退去，她聽到一個異常清晰的聲音——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保持緘默。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……這是教宗閣下的命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭特勤隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "即使薩卡茲已在一座城市犯下纍纍罪行，即使聖城拉特蘭從未受過如此挑釁與褻瀆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭特勤隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哪怕他們的軍隊正堂而皇之地威脅聖城周邊居民的安全，我們都還不能做出反應嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，教宗閣下認為拉特蘭不應干涉此事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉特蘭特勤隊成員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_371_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望見他——我要提出抗議！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "教宗騎士",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_358_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我們不確定他現在在哪裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "光環剎那間的擾動，以及突然的資訊洪流……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它因為某種情況突然感知到了什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“對話”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它在……與某種和它相似的存在對話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "既然它已主動做出選擇，恐怕我也應該效仿。它的預示，已非拉特蘭一己之力所能承擔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讓我想想……從第一個問題開始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伊萬杰利斯塔十一世",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……你是誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "靜止的虛空之中，有人踏了進來。\n他追隨著另一個人的腳步，儘管那足跡已經永遠地消失在這裡。\n塔仍在崩潰，暗示著剛剛發生的一切。\n哪怕時間在這裡都毫無意義，他也必須忍受自己慢了一步的事實。\n她已不在可被觸及的任何地方。\n如今，他的眼中，只有金色的海洋，和天空中孤獨的菱形。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
